<section id="S5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.3 </span>Ablation Studies</h3>

<div id="S5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Table <a href="#S5.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 5.3 Ablation Studies ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Predictive Preference Learning from Human Interventions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, we perform ablation studies of our <span id="S5.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">PPL</span> in the MetaDrive safety benchmark with the neural expert as proxy human policies.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T2" class="ltx_table">
