</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Additional Experimental Results</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the performance of our <span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">PPL</span> and all the baselines with neural experts as proxy human policies in MetaDrive (Table <a href="#A2.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Appendix B Additional Experimental Results ‣ Predictive Preference Learning from Human Interventions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>), Table Wiping (Table <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix B Additional Experimental Results ‣ Predictive Preference Learning from Human Interventions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>), and Nut Assembly (Table <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix B Additional Experimental Results ‣ Predictive Preference Learning from Human Interventions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>) tasks, respectively. The test success rate curves of all three tasks are shown in Fig. <a href="#S4.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ 4.1 Predictive Preference Learning from Human Interventions (PPL) ‣ 4 Method ‣ Predictive Preference Learning from Human Interventions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="A2.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison of methods with training/testing statistics in the MetaDrive environment with the neural expert as the proxy human policy. The overall intervention rate is given together with the expert data usage.</span></figcaption>
<div id="A2.T3.5" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:73.5pt;vertical-align:-35.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-171.3pt,36.5pt) scale(0.50168849507497,0.50168849507497) ;">
<table id="A2.T3.5.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A2.T3.5.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="A2.T3.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Method</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="A2.T3.5.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Expert-in-the-Loop</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="2"><span id="A2.T3.5.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Training</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="3"><span id="A2.T3.5.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Testing</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T3.5.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A2.T3.5.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Expert Data Usage</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A2.T3.5.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Total Data Usage</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A2.T3.5.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Success Rate</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A2.T3.5.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Episodic Return</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A2.T3.5.1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Route Completion</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T3.5.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Neural Expert</td>
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">–</td>
<td id="A2.T3.5.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">–</td>
